.TH SDL_GetGPUDriver 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetGPUDriver \- Get the name of a built in GPU driver.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "const char * SDL_GetGPUDriver(int index);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The GPU drivers are presented in the order in which they are normally checked during initialization\[char46]
.PP
The names of drivers are all simple, low-ASCII identifiers, like \(dqvulkan\(dq, \(dqmetal\(dq or \(dqdirect3d12\(dq\[char46] These never have Unicode characters, and are not meant to be proper names\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I index
the index of a GPU driver\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the name of the GPU driver with the given
.BR index
or NULL when the index is out of bounds; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_GetNumGPUDrivers (3)
